{"id":"posle","lemma":"после","pos":"prep","rank":106,"glosses":["after (in time)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/25/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Что он сделал после этого?","en":"What did he do after that?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},null,null]},{"text":"Что ты делаешь после работы?","en":"What do you do after work?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null,{"g":"work","l":"работа"}]},{"text":"После вас.","en":"After you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/58097","words":[null,{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Что мы будем делать после этого?","en":"What do we do after this?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"to make, to do"},null,null]},{"text":"После смерти нет ничего.","en":"After death there is nothing.","words":[null,{"g":"death","l":"смерть"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"nothing"}]}]}